{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "coding-016", "category": "coding", "title": "Natural sort order", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 205204, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 29751, "reasoning_tokens": 29614, "input_tokens": 199, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 438, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 110578, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "total": 13, "failures": [], "pass": true, "load_error": null, "passed": 13}, "workflow_id": "0sfj67e9ec7c-d02b-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj676d394b-d02b-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:23:53-0500", "answer": "```python\nimport re\n\n_RUN_RE = re.compile(r'[0-9]+|[^0-9]+')\n\ndef _run_key(run: str):\n    if '0' <= run[0] <= '9':\n        stripped = run.lstrip('0')\n        return (0, len(stripped), stripped, len(run))\n    return (1, run.lower())\n\ndef _natural_key(s: str):\n    runs = _RUN_RE.findall(s)\n    return (tuple(_run_key(run) for run in runs), s)\n\ndef natural_sort(items: list[str]) -> list[str]:\n    return sorted(items, key=_natural_key)\n```"}
