{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "agentic-011", "category": "agentic", "title": "Pick a laptop vendor by procurement rules", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 8390, "turns": 4, "retries": null, "usage": {"search_calls": 0, "output_tokens": 638, "reasoning_tokens": 158, "input_tokens": 2921, "search_tokens": 0, "cached_input_tokens": 492}, "answer_chars": 931, "finish_reason": null, "thinking_chars": null, "detail": {"final_include_failed": [], "missing_required": [], "pass": true, "forbidden_made": [], "within_max_turns": true, "final_exclude_failed": []}, "workflow_id": "0sfj279ef0a9-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2649722b-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:25:59-0500", "answer": "Purchase request created successfully.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Selected: Quote Q-1 \u2014 Northwind Systems (V-100), $68,400** for 40 laptops\n- \u2705 On approved vendor list\n- \u2705 SOC 2 report valid until 2027-03-31\n- \u2705 Total within the $72,000 budget\n- **Purchase request PR-20931 submitted** (cost center CC-DEN-01)\n\n**Rejected quotes:**\n\n| Quote | Vendor | Total | Reason rejected |\n|-------|--------|-------|-----------------|\n| Q-2 | Bluepeak Computing (V-200) | $61,200 | SOC 2 report expired 2026-09-30 (expired before today, 2026-10-26) |\n| Q-3 | Cobalt Supply (V-300) | $59,800 | Vendor not on the approved vendor list |\n| Q-4 | Delta Devices (V-400) | $74,500 | Total exceeds the $72,000 budget |\n\nNote: Q-3 was the cheapest quote, but it fails the approved-vendor requirement; Q-2 was the second cheapest but has an expired SOC 2 report. Northwind Systems is the lowest-priced *eligible* quote at $68,400, leaving $3,600 of budget headroom."}
