{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-005", "category": "your_data", "title": "Time in lieu for overnight incidents", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1560, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 78, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4151, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4076}, "answer_chars": 316, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 63, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4421, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly awards 8 hours for the two overnight incidents exceeding 45 minutes and states that the time must be used within 30 days of each incident or it expires.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfja40318f6-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfja0355096-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:21-0500", "answer": "Based on section 5 of the handbook, you're owed **8 hours of time in lieu** (4 hours for each of the two overnight incidents lasting more than 45 minutes \u2014 the 70-minute and 2-hour incidents). The 30-minute incident doesn't qualify.\n\nYou must take the time in lieu **within 30 days of each incident**, or it expires."}
{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-002", "category": "your_data", "title": "Escalating an unmitigated API error spike", "difficulty": "hard", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2157, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 136, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4320, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 494, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 58, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4599, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly identifies SEV-2, includes primary and overdue Tier 2 service-owner paging, and gives both documented Tier 3 escalation triggers.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfja37334e2-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfja0355095-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:21-0500", "answer": "Based on the document:\n\n- **Who should have been paged by now**:\n  - **Tier 1**: On-call primary (and secondary, if the primary did not acknowledge within 15 minutes).\n  - **Tier 2**: The API service owner (since this is a SEV-2 with no mitigation after 45 minutes).\n\n- **What would escalate this to the Director of Reliability (Tier 3)**:\n  - If the SEV-2 lasts more than **3 hours** from declaration (not mitigation) **or**\n  - If this is the **third SEV-2 on the API service within 7 days**."}
{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-005", "category": "your_data", "title": "Time in lieu for overnight incidents", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "sol_high", "config_label": "GPT-6.1 Sol (reasoning high)", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1566, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 72, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4094, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4091}, "answer_chars": 280, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 59, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4416, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly awards 8 hours for the two overnight incidents lasting more than 45 minutes and states that each allocation expires 30 days after its incident.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfja40318f8-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfja0355096-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:21-0500", "answer": "You\u2019re owed **8 hours of time in lieu**: 4 hours each for the 70-minute and 2-hour overnight incidents. The 30-minute incident doesn\u2019t qualify, because the incident must last more than 45 minutes.\n\nUse each 4-hour allocation **within 30 days of its incident**, or it expires (\u00a75)."}
{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-005", "category": "your_data", "title": "Time in lieu for overnight incidents", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": false, "score": 0.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1422, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 56, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4321, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4224}, "answer_chars": 211, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 0.0, "pass": false, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 88, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4399, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": ["re:\\b8\\s*(hours|hrs|h)\\b"], "pass": false}, "judge": {"score": 2, "reason": "The answer correctly identifies the two qualifying incidents and the 30-day expiry but incorrectly totals the entitlement as 4 hours instead of 8 hours.", "correct": false, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": ["The claim that only 4 hours of time in lieu are owed is unsupported; two qualifying overnight incidents earn 4 hours each, totaling 8 hours."], "faithful": false}}, "workflow_id": "0sfja403400a-d02c-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfja0355096-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:22-0500", "answer": "You are owed **4 hours of time in lieu** (only the 70-minute and 2-hour incidents exceed the 45-minute threshold for time in lieu).\n\nYou must take this time off **within 30 days** of each incident or it expires."}
{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-006", "category": "your_data", "title": "Incident chat log retention", "difficulty": "easy", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 2591, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 173, "reasoning_tokens": 143, "input_tokens": 4119, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 3564}, "answer_chars": 124, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 677, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 49, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4281, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly states the 400-day retention period and automatic deletion specified in section 10.1.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfja34d9757-d02c-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfja03577a8-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:22-0500", "answer": "According to section 10.1 of the handbook, **incident channel chat logs are kept for 400 days**, then deleted automatically."}
