{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-009", "category": "your_data", "title": "Weekly on-call pay with extra pages", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l3", "config_label": "Mistral Large 3 (baseline)", "model": "mistral-large-2512", "reasoning_effort": null, "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1547, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 95, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4302, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 255, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 55, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4377, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly calculates $810 as the $450 primary stipend plus $360 for three additional out-of-hours pages at $120 each.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfjb3de07d2-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjb3b6e8bd-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:49-0500", "answer": "For your week as primary on-call with 8 out-of-hours pages:\n\n- **Weekly stipend**: $450 (covers the first 5 out-of-hours pages).\n- **Page pay**: $120 \u00d7 (8 - 5) = $360 for the 3 additional out-of-hours pages.\n\n**Total on-call pay**: $450 + $360 = **$810**."}
{"run_id": "full-r2", "item_id": "your_data-009", "category": "your_data", "title": "Weekly on-call pay with extra pages", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "sol_high", "config_label": "GPT-6.1 Sol (reasoning high)", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 1682, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 77, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4077, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 4074}, "answer_chars": 277, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "pass": true, "judge_usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 59, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 4371, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "programmatic": {"missing_facts": [], "pass": true}, "judge": {"score": 5, "reason": "The answer correctly calculates $810 from the $450 primary stipend plus three additional pages at $120 each, and the submission deadline is supported by the handbook.", "correct": true, "parsed": true, "hallucinations": [], "faithful": true}}, "workflow_id": "0sfjb3de2ee5-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfjb3b6e8bd-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:29:49-0500", "answer": "Your on-call pay for that complete primary week is **$810**:\n\n- Primary stipend: **$450**, covering the first 5 out-of-hours pages.\n- Additional page pay: (8 \u2212 5) \u00d7 $120 = **$360**.\n\nSubmit it through the payroll on-call form by the **3rd business day of the following month**."}
